{"title":"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 4b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <i>geometric</i> sequence is a sequence in which each term after the first is obtained from the previous term by multiplying it by a non-zero constant, called the <i>common ratio</i>. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/455e64dfca6a85a26a7b425a8df331c412a8466b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5, 10, 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" /> is a geometric sequence with three terms and a common ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/318ffc82a3db81580895e9d29c19646f376047b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, 12, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" /> is a geometric sequence and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a10a89f8e8ff2ff17342e737ea1d56f73733c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />.a\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the common ratio of the sequence. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/c/8bc4592d211c552fe16f05c02ed9e3ef652ca7a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{12}{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef848c1998c7d933d93b9cbb4f2f979190cbba43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f1e88cb7d47305cfe18e39880ae12a1ff1b656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, we get\n\\begin{align*}\n\t\\frac{12}{r} + 12r &amp;= 25\\\\\n\t12r^{2} - 25r + 12 &amp;= 0\n\\end{align*}\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09372266f72fa589bc1aba24cf2c6e85c55d946b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd6a9560702def54c5d7221592ed9987d8a4180.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-25$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2308b3e7a0c5cd6d78ef80121021e03deb4f0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\times 12 = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />, so we have\n\\begin{align*}\n\t12r^{2} - 16r - 9r + 12 &amp;= 0\\\\\n\t4r(3r - 4) - 3(3r - 4) &amp;= 0\\\\\n\t(4r - 3)(3r - 4) &amp;= 0\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Thus, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de0b18032fc954b3de709135415682202ec0c6fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4r - 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14dacdb9bb89d770a8d6704682be2a70b285394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3r - 4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de0b18032fc954b3de709135415682202ec0c6fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4r - 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06162ef4a193b84be6dad1629621a9f16ca47ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"38\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/512e709c007b35c102a8cf4aa58c70473773ab54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\frac{12}{\\frac{3}{4}} = 12 \\times \\frac{4}{3} = 16 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad y = 12 \\times \\frac{3}{4} = 9.\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"43\" />\nHence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18ea22ac2804178b81e6d7ac0cb29244ba7259db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(16, 9)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14dacdb9bb89d770a8d6704682be2a70b285394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3r - 4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f4713734ab109fc946c17b73bf08efe2985f8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11dd9a3f63b811b720da9d873642eec907cf2406.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\frac{12}{\\frac{4}{3}} = 12 \\times \\frac{3}{4} = 9 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad y = 12 \\times \\frac{4}{3} = 16.\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"43\" />\nHence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc127110873320167b9b124cce0a8246fb8b21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(9, 16)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the common ratio of the sequence. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/c/facf8c11e81c109c48b69053cc22c1d9166f1749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xr = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257e352710a2adfdd53cde3a4a3100fba469d156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12r = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0ddb682adfa4faf66e1dc21dfe91d9af4c21201a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{12}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a68e72a6b7b01f39c3c6e66b385a79ac5f821621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{y}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"34\" />. This implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d49baf03ea5a112b81a955bb7941054d063725fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{12}{x} = \\frac{y}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1eda32892978ed5c134f5b991c1f296e35433c9a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy = 12 \\times 12 = 144\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We rearrange <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a10a89f8e8ff2ff17342e737ea1d56f73733c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/181d10927bf81b2b15e72c18b0a3d55cfe48b93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 25 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcba4f4d70e34fdce56815c5cbf9641733927a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />, we get\n\\begin{align*}\n\tx(25 - x) &amp;= 144\\\\\n\t-x^{2} + 25x &amp;= 144\\\\\n\tx^{2} - 25x + 144 &amp;= 0\n\\end{align*}\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09372266f72fa589bc1aba24cf2c6e85c55d946b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> while multiplying to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50ff9540650f0f95f80da2f6692fc8ee413e2eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$144$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, so we get:\n\\begin{align*}\n\tx^{2} - 9x - 16x + 144 &amp;= 0\\\\\n\tx(x - 9) - 16(x - 9) &amp;= 0\\\\\n\t(x - 16)(x - 9) &amp;= 0\n\\end{align*}\nThus, the roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cae13a8f6458d5d8c61ba965d0abb4b08da072.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/7408f40d28f4f1912cbc9d5ab5b69112aa112204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 25 - 16 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a7a2005b67ab81ee5ff231b2f370f1d71ebe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99596009350d39b088ab3e5aaea64c9834248a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 25 - 9 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"17\" />. We then see that the solutions would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc127110873320167b9b124cce0a8246fb8b21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(9, 16)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18ea22ac2804178b81e6d7ac0cb29244ba7259db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(16, 9)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 200/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 404/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8520/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.352      1 2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_4\n100.00%    6.352      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36326:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018032331 and revision id 281371. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}